WEBVTT

00:01.710 --> 00:03.440
I'm sorry, Oscar,

00:03.440 --> 00:06.420
for making you help me on your day off.

00:06.990 --> 00:08.110
It's fine.

00:13.900 --> 00:15.090
Well then...

00:19.130 --> 00:20.940
Is this blood?

00:27.560 --> 00:28.650
"Aeti"...

00:43.510 --> 00:45.390
Where have I seen this before?

00:47.740 --> 00:48.730
What's this?

00:52.610 --> 00:53.600
Oscar!

00:55.420 --> 00:56.110
Oscar!

01:18.190 --> 01:20.910
The tower's... gone?

01:32.740 --> 01:34.030
Bingo.

01:34.030 --> 01:35.240
I lucked out.

01:37.280 --> 01:38.300
Who are you?

01:38.300 --> 01:39.990
I'm not here to hurt you.

01:39.990 --> 01:41.580
Don't make any noise.

01:42.190 --> 01:45.270
I came here for your help, Tinasha.

01:51.070 --> 01:52.960
Who <i>are</i> you?

01:53.260 --> 01:55.420
Your future husband.

01:56.700 --> 01:58.350
Did you hit your head?

01:59.010 --> 02:01.140
If I'm dreaming, I'd love to wake up.

02:01.140 --> 02:07.150
I heard from someone in town earlier that 
it's the year 236 in the Tuldarr calendar.

02:07.150 --> 02:08.600
Yes, that's right.

02:09.060 --> 02:10.650
That settles it.

02:10.650 --> 02:14.320
I'm from the year 654, in Tuldarr time.

02:14.320 --> 02:17.530
Are you saying you came here 
from four hundred years in the future?

02:19.810 --> 02:23.200
There is no magical law 
that lets you go back in time.

02:23.200 --> 02:24.650
It's impossible.

02:24.650 --> 02:27.660
You told me the same thing once before.

02:27.660 --> 02:30.120
So I'd like to wake up soon if I'm dreaming.

02:30.420 --> 02:31.330
Please wake me up.

02:31.330 --> 02:32.540
Why me?

02:32.890 --> 02:34.940
In any case, you're my only hope.

02:34.940 --> 02:36.540
Send me back to my original time.

02:36.540 --> 02:39.060
I just said you can't travel in time.

02:39.060 --> 02:43.050
Maybe you could live for four hundred 
years placed magically into slumber,

02:43.050 --> 02:46.540
but men's bodies are too unstable for that.

02:46.540 --> 02:48.450
Is there no other way?

02:48.450 --> 02:49.220
Nope.

02:54.060 --> 02:55.280
Is that a problem?

02:55.280 --> 02:56.230
It is.

02:56.780 --> 02:57.910
I see...

03:05.890 --> 03:09.970
I'll see if I can't find something, then.

03:10.900 --> 03:13.180
You can stay here until then.

03:13.580 --> 03:16.150
No one ever comes here, anyway.

03:16.150 --> 03:17.460
Really?

03:23.430 --> 03:26.640
It might take some time, is that okay?

03:26.640 --> 03:28.350
Yeah, thanks.

03:28.350 --> 03:32.770
I'm grateful, but don't let your 
guard down around strangers like that.

03:32.770 --> 03:34.940
What right do you have to say that?

03:41.100 --> 03:42.930
Go to sleep for today.

03:42.930 --> 03:45.430
I'll find an empty room somewhere.

03:45.430 --> 03:47.810
What? Just stay here.

03:47.810 --> 03:49.020
I swear...

03:49.020 --> 03:52.720
I'm pretty small, so I won't be in your way.

03:52.720 --> 03:54.720
Or are you into little kids?

03:54.720 --> 03:56.410
Don't accuse people like that.

03:56.410 --> 03:58.010
How old are you now?

03:58.010 --> 03:59.210
Thirteen.

04:00.970 --> 04:01.890
What?

04:02.630 --> 04:04.970
No, it's nothing.

04:05.820 --> 04:08.730
I'll be right here then, so get some sleep.

04:08.730 --> 04:10.290
You're not a morning person, right?

04:10.290 --> 04:11.930
H-How do you know that?

04:11.930 --> 04:12.880
Bed. Now.

04:12.880 --> 04:14.310
Okay, I get it.

04:18.440 --> 04:20.250
Good night, Tinasha.

04:21.270 --> 04:22.860
Good night.

04:23.260 --> 04:26.130
You really are an odd one.

04:27.140 --> 04:30.170
For some reason, it's really...

04:36.410 --> 04:39.980
You have to do all this as queen candidate?

04:41.130 --> 04:43.760
There's the possibility 
I could be assassinated,

04:43.760 --> 04:47.290
so I learned to take care 
of most things myself.

04:47.590 --> 04:49.260
It's fine, though.

04:49.260 --> 04:51.350
I may live by myself, but I'm not alone.

04:51.830 --> 04:53.490
The kingdom is here for me.

04:53.490 --> 04:56.450
I need to study hard to serve 
its people and protect them.

04:56.810 --> 04:59.900
I'm doing my best 
so I don't let them down in the future.

05:00.510 --> 05:01.590
I see.

05:03.940 --> 05:05.070
What's wrong?

05:05.610 --> 05:06.360
Nothing.

05:07.630 --> 05:10.490
Your tea's just so good.

05:14.690 --> 05:17.920
How much longer until your next birthday?

05:17.920 --> 05:19.290
The next one?

05:19.290 --> 05:21.380
About half a year left.

05:21.380 --> 05:22.820
Half a year...

05:24.210 --> 05:27.130
<i>If I stayed here in this era...</i>

05:27.690 --> 05:31.180
<i>If I could save her from that tragedy...</i>

05:36.340 --> 05:38.020
So, do you remember yet?

05:38.020 --> 05:40.940
The magic implement that sent you to the past.

05:40.940 --> 05:42.000
No...

05:42.000 --> 05:45.950
I've seen it before, but where was it again?

05:47.610 --> 05:50.320
What's with that sword of yours?

05:50.320 --> 05:52.500
Magic doesn't work on this sword.

05:52.500 --> 05:55.010
There's only one sword like that in the world.

05:55.010 --> 05:56.820
Akashia of Farsas.

05:56.820 --> 05:58.170
That's the one.

05:58.170 --> 06:00.500
You're Farsas royalty?

06:00.500 --> 06:01.340
Yep.

06:01.340 --> 06:02.800
What?!

06:05.760 --> 06:07.640
It dispersed my spell!

06:07.640 --> 06:09.010
I remember now.

06:09.010 --> 06:09.720
What?

06:10.010 --> 06:12.360
I saw it in the Farsas treasury.

06:12.360 --> 06:13.650
Except it was red...

06:15.140 --> 06:17.670
Should we head to Farsas, then?

06:19.730 --> 06:22.530
No, it was my mother's keepsake.

06:22.530 --> 06:24.740
It doesn't exist in Farsas in this era.

06:24.740 --> 06:26.800
Your mother's passed away?

06:26.800 --> 06:28.360
When I was a kid.

06:28.730 --> 06:29.840
I see...

06:29.840 --> 06:30.800
Don't feel bad.

06:30.800 --> 06:31.750
I don't remember her.

06:31.750 --> 06:32.910
Yeah.

06:32.910 --> 06:34.270
I'm sorry.

06:36.070 --> 06:37.540
Oh, that's right.

06:37.860 --> 06:40.050
The one I touched was blue.

06:40.050 --> 06:41.080
I found it in the tower...

06:41.460 --> 06:44.360
I think it came from the Tuldarr treasury.

06:44.360 --> 06:45.220
I can't do that.

06:45.220 --> 06:47.840
No one can enter the treasury 
without the king's authorization.

06:47.840 --> 06:51.300
Besides, I can't trust you with that.

06:51.300 --> 06:52.570
That's true.

06:52.570 --> 06:53.540
My bad.

06:55.260 --> 06:58.220
It took you a while to warm up to me before.

06:58.730 --> 07:00.540
What do you mean?

07:00.540 --> 07:01.750
Don't mind me.

07:03.090 --> 07:05.150
Hey, what's that?

07:05.480 --> 07:07.050
What do you mean by "that"?

07:07.050 --> 07:08.490
Inside your body.

07:09.490 --> 07:12.320
Such complicated curses and blessings...

07:12.700 --> 07:13.920
You can see them?

07:13.920 --> 07:14.850
Yeah.

07:14.850 --> 07:18.620
There was an extremely strong 
blessing placed on me as a child.

07:18.620 --> 07:21.290
To cancel it out, I had a curse placed on me.

07:21.290 --> 07:22.640
Huh...

07:22.640 --> 07:24.570
C-Can I get some of your blood later?

07:24.570 --> 07:26.560
I'd love to analyze it.

07:26.560 --> 07:28.860
I don't mind, but is it that interesting?

07:28.860 --> 07:30.410
I like doing research.

07:30.410 --> 07:32.480
And everything's worth trying at least once.

07:32.480 --> 07:34.850
How about I train you to use a sword, then?

07:35.290 --> 07:35.890
What?

07:36.420 --> 07:37.460
What?!

07:37.460 --> 07:39.290
It'll be useful in the future.

07:39.290 --> 07:40.100
You ought to do it.

07:40.100 --> 07:43.560
No matter what you say, 
I won't leave you alone.

07:49.790 --> 07:53.200
Oscar, what did you do back in Farsas?

07:53.200 --> 07:56.780
You carry the royal sword, 
so you're a direct heir to the throne, right?

07:56.780 --> 07:59.200
Dunno. What <i>did</i> I do?

07:59.200 --> 08:01.100
Can I spend the afternoon doing research?

08:01.100 --> 08:01.660
Sure.

08:13.970 --> 08:16.470
This dragon's really friendly.

08:16.470 --> 08:18.620
It must know who you are.

08:18.620 --> 08:21.320
You're the one who gave it to me to begin with.

08:21.320 --> 08:22.430
Really?

08:22.430 --> 08:23.380
Yeah.

08:24.060 --> 08:26.740
Hey, what am I like in the future?

08:27.150 --> 08:28.600
A fine lady.

08:28.600 --> 08:30.110
Like none other.

08:31.410 --> 08:32.750
Don't give me that.

08:33.500 --> 08:36.070
I know that marriage stuff is a lie.

08:36.070 --> 08:38.440
Well, I'm sure it's hard to believe.

08:38.440 --> 08:40.860
Oh, I need to get back to my room!

08:40.860 --> 08:42.250
I forgot Lanak's coming.

08:42.830 --> 08:43.870
Lanak?

08:43.870 --> 08:45.800
You know him?

08:45.800 --> 08:50.030
He's been busy lately, 
but he comes and visits often.

08:52.740 --> 08:54.510
It looks great on you, Aeti.

08:54.510 --> 08:56.720
I had it made just for you.

08:56.720 --> 08:58.390
I'm glad to hear that.

09:05.530 --> 09:06.620
Aeti.

09:07.310 --> 09:08.510
What?

09:10.970 --> 09:12.390
Oh, nothing.

09:13.560 --> 09:17.560
I know I just arrived, 
but I must be leaving for today.

09:17.560 --> 09:18.200
Okay...

09:21.160 --> 09:23.060
Lanak, wait.

09:23.060 --> 09:24.120
What is it?

09:24.440 --> 09:25.820
I have a favor to ask.

09:30.300 --> 09:31.260
Tinasha.

09:33.760 --> 09:35.480
You scared me.

09:35.480 --> 09:37.020
That necklace...

09:37.720 --> 09:39.930
Lanak gave it to me.

09:39.930 --> 09:43.930
Oh, I asked Lanak 
to get me into the treasury...

09:43.930 --> 09:45.640
Don't trust that man.

09:45.640 --> 09:48.140
Huh? Why not?

09:50.060 --> 09:53.500
You don't know Lanak at all, do you?

09:53.900 --> 09:57.110
He's the only family I have.

09:57.110 --> 09:59.820
He's going to hurt you.

10:01.450 --> 10:04.730
You don't know anything about me...

10:05.290 --> 10:07.290
Stop making up lies!

10:07.290 --> 10:09.750
Lanak is the only one who stayed by my side!

10:10.610 --> 10:12.230
I don't have anyone else.

10:12.650 --> 10:14.170
Without him...

10:15.470 --> 10:18.270
I'd be truly alone...

10:20.590 --> 10:22.510
Let go of me, idiot!

10:24.210 --> 10:28.670
There's no way I'd be okay being all alone...

10:30.510 --> 10:34.240
I wanted to see my mom and my dad!

10:34.240 --> 10:37.820
I wanted to be a normal kid, just for one day!

10:37.820 --> 10:38.820
But...

10:39.130 --> 10:42.010
They said someone had to do it...

10:42.010 --> 10:44.870
They said it'd get better when I grew up...

10:47.050 --> 10:50.250
But the truth is, I've been 
putting up with it all along...

10:54.110 --> 10:56.100
It's okay, Tinasha.

10:57.210 --> 10:59.320
You won't be alone in the future.

10:59.320 --> 11:00.680
I guarantee it.

11:00.680 --> 11:03.410
You'll come and find me for sure.

11:04.130 --> 11:05.540
You'll find happiness.

11:08.710 --> 11:12.130
There's no way she wouldn't be lonely, huh?

11:26.580 --> 11:28.020
I'm sorry.

11:29.690 --> 11:30.540
Nah.

11:31.290 --> 11:33.380
I should have put it differently.

11:35.950 --> 11:38.490
I know just how hard you've worked.

11:40.370 --> 11:44.430
Lanak said he'd take me to the treasury.

11:44.430 --> 11:45.850
I see.

11:45.850 --> 11:46.850
Thanks.

11:55.810 --> 11:56.770
Oscar!

11:57.110 --> 11:57.980
How'd it go?

11:57.980 --> 11:59.960
I really found it!

11:59.960 --> 12:01.700
A blue orb about this big.

12:01.700 --> 12:04.900
I couldn't take it with me, 
so I did a bit of tampering instead.

12:04.900 --> 12:11.010
At the end of the day, the warding spell 
against intruders will be disabled for one hour.

12:11.370 --> 12:13.330
So I can go in myself?

12:16.180 --> 12:19.660
Now I can finally see you again...

12:22.470 --> 12:26.640
Do I really end up marrying you?

12:26.640 --> 12:27.940
It's true.

12:27.940 --> 12:32.600
Four hundred years from now, 
the year 527 in the Farsas calendar.

12:32.880 --> 12:34.880
I'll be there waiting.

12:34.880 --> 12:38.060
I'll make sure you find happiness, 
so look forward to it.

12:39.570 --> 12:40.920
More importantly...

12:40.920 --> 12:43.210
Don't hang around Lanak too much.

12:43.210 --> 12:45.150
Who made you my nosy dad?

12:45.530 --> 12:47.660
I'm not your dad or your brother.

12:47.660 --> 12:49.490
I'm your husband.

12:50.700 --> 12:51.790
See you later.

12:52.590 --> 12:53.410
Yeah.

12:54.280 --> 12:55.350
See you.

12:56.370 --> 12:57.810
Take care...

13:11.100 --> 13:13.120
Huh? Aeti?

13:13.120 --> 13:14.060
You were awake?

13:14.060 --> 13:17.520
Lanak, what are you doing here so late?

13:21.050 --> 13:22.820
There's no mistaking it.

13:30.380 --> 13:32.710
<i>Why did I come to this era?</i>

13:33.870 --> 13:35.980
<i>Wasn't it because if I was by her side,</i>

13:36.410 --> 13:40.230
<i>I thought I could save her from that tragedy?</i>

13:41.970 --> 13:46.660
<i>But four hundred years later, 
she smiles so happily.</i>

13:46.660 --> 13:50.260
<i>Even if I go back now, 
she'll eventually find happiness.</i>

13:51.310 --> 13:52.570
Four hundred years...

13:54.560 --> 13:55.820
That's way too long!

13:56.690 --> 13:58.310
Wait, I still...

14:01.820 --> 14:04.940
~ Two Joined Memories ~

14:05.630 --> 14:06.700
Lanak.

14:06.700 --> 14:09.160
Who are these people?

14:09.160 --> 14:11.370
Don't you move, Aeti.

14:21.470 --> 14:22.770
Looks like I made it.

14:23.500 --> 14:25.630
This is why I said to stay away from him.

14:25.980 --> 14:27.620
O-Oscar...

14:27.620 --> 14:28.340
Why are you...

14:28.340 --> 14:29.800
Kill him!

14:33.130 --> 14:34.700
Lanak?

14:36.380 --> 14:37.670
It's okay.

14:38.570 --> 14:40.100
I'll take care of it.

14:47.230 --> 14:48.240
Put up a barrier.

14:48.530 --> 14:49.710
Protect yourself.

15:06.710 --> 15:08.090
My goodness...

15:08.090 --> 15:11.010
Where did you even find this man?

15:11.010 --> 15:13.290
You exist for my sake.

15:14.460 --> 15:16.930
So she should sacrifice herself for you

15:16.930 --> 15:20.290
and have her flesh and blood used 
to summon magical power?

15:20.890 --> 15:22.260
Aeti...

15:22.260 --> 15:23.880
Poor Aeti...

15:23.880 --> 15:25.260
I love you.

15:25.260 --> 15:26.990
I find you beautiful.

15:27.360 --> 15:29.970
But your magic is a nuisance.

15:29.970 --> 15:32.320
Just looking at you annoys me.

15:33.280 --> 15:34.740
Don't listen to him, Tinasha.

15:35.950 --> 15:37.980
His words are laced with poison.

15:37.980 --> 15:39.510
You can move on.

15:40.160 --> 15:41.620
Live on with courage.

15:41.620 --> 15:42.530
Believe me.

15:48.810 --> 15:49.860
Lanak.

15:51.410 --> 15:55.600
Hate or loathe me all you want.

15:55.890 --> 15:57.430
Thanks for everything.

15:58.810 --> 15:59.850
And...

16:10.230 --> 16:14.220
If you insist on trying to kill me, 
I'll take you on.

16:15.420 --> 16:17.450
If I had more power, you'd be...

16:17.760 --> 16:18.910
Begin the incantations!

16:19.260 --> 16:20.940
Y-Your Highness...

16:20.940 --> 16:22.350
Hurry it up!

16:23.370 --> 16:26.750
Current which flows 
and flows not in this place...

16:26.750 --> 16:29.930
What I desire is unadulterated power.

16:29.930 --> 16:34.360
Draw upon this flesh and blood 
to appear before me, power!

16:36.170 --> 16:37.230
Lanak!

16:49.190 --> 16:51.400
<i>He's going to use himself as a catalyst?</i>

16:53.730 --> 16:57.070
Behold, Aeterna, as I surpass you!

16:58.990 --> 17:01.670
Let me show you the power of a king!

17:04.350 --> 17:05.530
Wh-What's this?

17:05.870 --> 17:06.840
Oh no!

17:06.840 --> 17:08.210
You mustn't go any further!

17:08.210 --> 17:09.460
Stop the summoning spell!

17:09.460 --> 17:11.170
Quiet, little girl!

17:17.550 --> 17:18.510
This isn't good!

17:28.100 --> 17:30.570
Oh no! I can't stop it!

17:36.200 --> 17:39.550
If this keeps up, Tuldarr will be destroyed!

17:40.530 --> 17:42.120
It's over, huh?

17:44.580 --> 17:45.700
You do it.

17:45.700 --> 17:46.980
Bring it under control.

17:46.980 --> 17:48.040
What?

17:48.040 --> 17:49.170
It's impossible!

17:49.170 --> 17:50.500
You saw what happened to Lanak!

17:50.500 --> 17:53.050
You can do it. I know you can.

17:53.050 --> 17:54.830
You have the power.

17:56.520 --> 17:57.820
Really?

17:58.610 --> 17:59.300
Yeah.

17:59.300 --> 18:00.640
This is your kingdom.

18:00.640 --> 18:02.600
It's fine. You still have time.

18:02.900 --> 18:04.560
You'll protect it.

18:05.710 --> 18:07.330
Let's triumph with ease.

18:07.810 --> 18:09.270
I'm here for you.

18:12.730 --> 18:13.780
Here I go.

18:35.250 --> 18:36.820
It's okay.

18:36.820 --> 18:37.820
It's over.

18:38.600 --> 18:39.710
Well done.

18:50.790 --> 18:53.970
Tinasha, I ended up lying to you.

18:54.820 --> 18:55.890
I'm sorry.

18:57.740 --> 19:01.060
I came here to save you.

19:01.060 --> 19:01.820
What?

19:01.820 --> 19:04.820
So we won't meet again.

19:05.220 --> 19:06.040
Why not?

19:08.260 --> 19:10.850
You just need to go back 
to your own time, right?

19:13.260 --> 19:15.920
There's nowhere for me to return anymore.

19:16.260 --> 19:18.950
It vanished when I came here.

19:19.810 --> 19:21.540
Vanished?

19:22.900 --> 19:27.930
I once asked Tinasha about a legend 
told of a village near Minnedart Fortress.

19:28.430 --> 19:32.460
A swordsman who traveled 
from the future to save his mother.

19:32.460 --> 19:34.510
Why was it that he disappeared after that?

19:35.820 --> 19:37.440
The answer is simple.

19:37.440 --> 19:39.490
The world doesn't branch off into paths.

19:39.800 --> 19:41.880
Should you attempt to change the past,

19:41.880 --> 19:46.450
the moment you travel back in time, 
a new history begins to take its place.

19:47.660 --> 19:50.150
In the instant that 
the magic sphere is activated,

19:50.150 --> 19:52.590
the world that the wielder 
came from is destroyed.

19:53.990 --> 19:58.130
It's a magic implement to change 
the past and overwrite history.

19:59.790 --> 20:03.050
Now that I've fulfilled my role, 
I should disappear as well in due time.

20:04.090 --> 20:05.620
That can't be true!

20:06.020 --> 20:07.010
I mean...

20:10.990 --> 20:15.580
<i>If I had known about the magic 
sphere's power from the start,</i>

20:15.580 --> 20:18.020
<i>I wouldn't have chosen to change the past.</i>

20:18.430 --> 20:22.790
<i>It's like denying 
the path she's led as a witch.</i>

20:23.350 --> 20:27.470
<i>To wish for all of the suffering 
she's faced to be wiped away...</i>

20:27.470 --> 20:29.230
<i>is nothing more than childish arrogance.</i>

20:29.950 --> 20:31.330
<i>I knew that.</i>

20:31.870 --> 20:34.230
<i>But even so...</i>

20:34.230 --> 20:38.300
<i>I wanted to hold your hand 
when you suffered the most.</i>

20:39.820 --> 20:42.300
<i>I don't regret this result.</i>

20:42.660 --> 20:43.650
Oscar...

20:44.210 --> 20:45.260
No...

20:45.560 --> 20:48.190
Become a good queen, Tinasha.

20:48.190 --> 20:49.720
You have the power to do so.

20:50.270 --> 20:53.970
The reality of the time 
I spent with you won't disappear.

20:54.890 --> 20:56.510
Even if you forget...

20:57.530 --> 20:58.940
Even if I forget...

20:59.650 --> 21:02.500
Even if we never met...

21:13.750 --> 21:15.510
I will always love you.

21:16.910 --> 21:18.050
Wait...

21:19.040 --> 21:20.340
Close your eyes.

21:22.250 --> 21:24.230
Don't leave me!

21:41.690 --> 21:42.940
Oscar?

23:06.510 --> 23:09.900
<i>A witch residing in an azure tower.</i>

23:10.790 --> 23:12.910
<i>A royal prince struck by a curse.</i>

23:21.270 --> 23:24.920
<i>If they could turn back time, 
what would they wish for?</i>

23:28.370 --> 23:32.470
<i>This is a story where everything 
can be rewritten.</i>
